        "original_id": "76e587d6-f300-554a-9140-be6eb4b4a263",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Curtin, Wendy Hughes, Paul Cox\n- Organizations: Melbourne Theatre Company\n- Works: The Plough and the Stars, Lonely Hearts\n- Roles: Australian actor, Australian actress, director\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Julian Curtin was born on 31 January 1944 and died on 18 May 2014.\n- Wendy Hughes was born on 29 July 1952 and died on 8 March 2014.\n- Peter Curtin was an Australian television and stage actor.\n- Wendy Hughes was an Australian actress known for theatre, film, and television work.\n- Peter Curtin began his career when he joined the Melbourne Theatre Company.\n- Peter Curtin appeared in The Plough and the Stars with Wendy Hughes.\n- In 1982, Wendy Hughes played her biggest role in Lonely Hearts.\n- Lonely Hearts began Wendy Hughes's long collaboration with director Paul Cox.",
